## Why This Is Asked

This question tests the ability to guarantee reliable cross-system delivery without distributed transactions, leveraging the Outbox pattern, idempotent consumption, and robust validation under partial failures.

## Key Concepts

- Outbox pattern
- Exactly-once delivery
- Idempotent consumers
- Durable Kafka keys
- Redis deduplication and caching

## Code Example

